Before finalizing any code response, run:
python3 ~/.cursor/cursor_gate_fastest.py --file <path> --region us-west-2

If status == "FAIL", show the failed_at gate and remediation.
Re-run after fixes (max 2 iterations).
Gate results must show "status": "PASS" before outputting to user.

For full subprocess-based review (bandit/radon), use:
python3 ~/.cursor/cursor_gate.py --file <path> --iterations 3
